  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudier och l&#xf6;nsamhets studie av vattenkraftverk vid Rusumo Falls  p&#xe5; gr&#xe4;sen mellan Rwanda och Tanzania. Studierna samfinasieras med WB  och Norge genom en s&#xe4;rskild fond f&#xf6;r Nilfloden, Nile Basin Trust Fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre- and Feasilibity studies for generation and project area          development on the Rusumo Falls Project,a hydropower plant on the     Kagera River on the border between Rwanda and Tanzania; with          transmission lines to connect the main networks in Rwanda, Burundi    and Tanzania. The feasibility study is financed jointly by WB, Norway and Sida through the WB&apos;s Nile Basin Trust fund.</narrative>
  </description>
